    "created_at": "2019-01-14T15:43:28Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-01-14T15:43:28Z",
    "body": "Or is the relevant bit https://w3c.github.io/navigation-timing/#processing-model and these timings only apply for navigation-related `load` events?  The spec is not very clear here.\r\n\r\nOf particular interest is the case when `open` is called on a document after parsing is done but before the `load` from the navigation fires.  What should happen in terms of these various pieces and why?",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
