    "body": "@igrigorik and/or @yoavweiss, can you take point on investigating and formalizing the spec for what `load` events navigation timing actually depends on? And perhaps creating an explicit integration point into the appropriate parts of the HTML spec, instead of monkeypatching it by inserting steps \"before the load event\" from another spec?",
